From: Robbie Cao <robbie.cao@arm.com>
Date: Tue, 25 Jul 2023 23:12:44 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] RSS: Abstract RSS common code for all platforms

This commit squashed all the downstream patches of RD-Fremont and
removed the platform specific code.

In future, this commit will be removed once we upgrade to TF-M master
branch where RD-Fremont code is upstreamed.

